Third-party notes
=================

Blink Live View Proxy
---------------------
https://github.com/Teethree89/ha-blink-live-view-proxy

Parts of this integration are copied from or adapted from Blink Live View
Proxy: the device refresh rules, camera controls, live-view (IMMIS) bridge,
the MPEG-TS audio guard, HLS session handling, push-to-talk encoding, clip
listing and caching, and the last-live-view cache. Each such file says so in
its header.

